	(text_box "Hall Sensor Inputs\n\nAssume VH required by motor hall sensors is 5V, but expose pad to switch to 3V3, if desired (XOR)\n\nUM2896 5.4: Use CH1-3 of TIM3 (PB4, PB5, PB0) for HA, HB, HC (built-in XOR)\n\nOptional MOTOR_TEMP pin if chosen motor provides winding temps (Note: This is different from the one in Control sheet)\n\nDC12_IN6 on PC0 used for MOTOR_TEMP based on availability\n\nNotes: \n- Only open-drain sensors are supported so added pull-up resistors and diodes to clamp voltage at 3V3 to protect MCU\n- Active 5V push-pull hall sensors are NOT supported, as the pins couldn't be mapped such that they are 5V-tolerant"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 50.8 0)
		(size 35.56 60.9599)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "058252ef-e6db-4954-9c3b-e1283fca4622")
	)
	(text_box "Misc. Header Pins\n\nFour unused pins remain, so pair with GND and expose"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142.24 147.32 0)
		(size 25.4 30.48)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ef522bc-9a3b-4728-ac9e-39f2fb4174a6")
	)
	(text_box "Serial (JST-PH)\n\n- Uses USART1_TX (PA9) & USART1_RX (PA10), which are 5V-tolerant\n- For sk8's Flipsky VX1's receiver module (JST-PH, soldered to JST-XH connector)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 86.4126 0)
		(size 22.86 25.3474)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "308dfcba-932b-499f-b5bf-98aa49e75756")
	)
	(text_box "Voltage Monitor\n\nMost power-related signals exposed through test points near pins"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58.42 147.32 0)
		(size 33.02 30.48)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "66f0c9e3-cd91-4c8d-adc2-87ad6d812bd6")
	)
	(text_box "Programming (STDC14)\n\nExpects STLINK-V3, so exposes pins through STDC14 connector\n\nUses MCU's internal VDD to determine if it's on "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 17.78 0)
		(size 15.24 30.5285)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
